; constellation zones pepper the WHOLE room regardless of the player
; (the choreography IS the fight). hp 440 = 40s at the g3 spine
; (sl-0187: 20-60s INTENSE; cooldowns compressed ~x0.7). One lead
; per pattern (zone arm 45 = the shared mud/spore vocabulary); elite
; amber; every number [T]; GATE 7 owns the length.

